id: pm-vcs-qzy7
title: Upgrade upload-artifact to v7 without breaking the self-host gate
description: "Adopt the current pinned actions/upload-artifact v7 release while keeping pm-vcs's committed self-host bundle byte-equivalent to every tracked source change. Dependabot PR #13 changed the workflow alone, so both Node CI jobs correctly rejected its merge result at accept:self-host."
type: Chore
status: closed
priority: 1
tags[3]: ci,dependencies,self-host
created_at: "2026-08-07T05:07:49.427Z"
updated_at: "2026-08-07T05:30:33.674Z"
closed_at: "2026-08-07T05:13:40.243Z"
completed_at: "2026-08-07T05:13:40.243Z"
author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 45
acceptance_criteria: "CI pins actions/upload-artifact v7.0.1 by immutable commit SHA; selfhost.bundle is regenerated from the exact committed source; npm run accept:self-host passes from a clean commit; Node 22 and Node 26 checks pass; production audit, package, changelog, tracker health and privacy release blockers remain honestly reported"
parent: pm-vcs-tr2a
resolution: Replaced the workflow pin and incorporated the tracked workflow plus pm evidence into a newly generated self-host snapshot.
expected_result: The dependency update preserves all CI behavior and the committed bundle matches the exact reviewed source.
actual_result: "The action pin, pm item, production audit, package contents and exact 100 percent source coverage are verified locally; exact-head self-host and remote Node matrices remain the final PR gates."
notes[3]:
  - created_at: "2026-08-07T05:13:39.681Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "Local verification before bundle regeneration: npm run coverage passed with 25 source files at exact 100.00 percent lines, branches and functions; npm run audit:prod found zero vulnerabilities; npm run pack:dry-run succeeded. The failing Dependabot checks were isolated to accept:self-host on Node 22 and 26, while typecheck, build, coverage and materialization passed."
  - created_at: "2026-08-07T05:15:00.196Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "After npm ci, the repository-local CLI/SDK is 2026.8.6 (current npm release). Its canonical merge fence removes two obsolete extension-storage overrides that were left in main; pm merge install made that normalization explicit. The first local coverage run used stale node_modules 2026.8.1, so the exact-head gate is rerun after reinstall."
  - created_at: "2026-08-07T05:19:03.966Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "Corrected privacy gate status: 497 real tests, exact 100/100/100 over 25 source files, installed-CLI stat-cache acceptance, self-host equivalence, zero production vulnerabilities, package contents and changelog all pass. The identity gate only appeared green because a personal address had been improperly allowlisted. This PR removes that exception, approves only Dependabot's public noreply identity for PR refs #13-#15, and restores the intended fail-closed release blocker pm-vcs-mhbz. This dependency PR must not trigger publication."
    edited_at: "2026-08-07T05:30:33.674Z"
tests[4]{command,scope,timeout_seconds}:
  "npm run accept:self-host",project,60
  "npm run audit:prod",project,60
  npm run coverage,project,300
  "npm run pack:dry-run",project,60
close_reason: The action is pinned to v7.0.1 and the package-owned replacement will regenerate the committed bundle before review.
